        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo utakapofanikiwa, ukiangalia kuzitenda amri, na hukumu, BWANA alizomwagizia Musa juu ya Israeli; uwe hodari, na wa moyo mkuu; usiogope wala usifadhaike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi sasa, tazama, katika shida yangu, nimeiwekea akiba nyumba ya BWANA, talanta laki moja za dhahabu, na talanta milioni moja za fedha; na shaba na chuma isiyo na uzani; kwa vile zilivyo tele; miti tena na mawe nimeweka akiba, nawe utaweza kuongeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena kwako kuna mafundi wengi, wenye kuchonga na kufanya kazi ya mawe na miti, na kila aliye stadi kwa kazi yoyote; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya dhahabu, ya fedha, na ya shaba, na ya chuma, hapana hesabu; basi inuka ushike kazi, naye BWANA na awe pamoja nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena Daudi akawaamuru viongozi wote wa Israeli, kwamba wamsaidie Sulemani mwanawe, akisema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
